<title>SOUTH AFRICA: New Clicks details half year results.</title>
<headline>New Clicks details half year results.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Feb 28, 1997 vs 10 months ended Aug 31, 1996</p>
<p>		 (million of rand unless indicated)</p>
<p>    Shr (cts)	     15.7	vs    18.1</p>
<p>    Interim div (cts)    4.0	vs    6.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	 38.8	vs    43.9</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		 50.6	vs    59.4</p>
<p>    Tax		     11.6	vs    15.4</p>
<p>    Interest paid	  7.5	vs    7.6</p>
<p>    Turnover	     958.2	vs    1,337.4</p>
<p>Div payment June 25</p>
<p>on register May 16</p>
<p>Full name: New Clicks Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE: Shareholders will be offered capitalisation shares in lieu of the dividend in a ratio to be advised.</p>
<p>-- Cape Town newsroom +27 21 25-2238</p>
</text>
